    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST SPARKY MARKY: EPISODE 3</h1><p></p><br><h1>LIKE SPARKY? PLAY EPISODE 1</h1><p></p><br><h1>LIKE SPARKY? WISHLIST ONLINE GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>You are a worker of the Amber's Park Camp, so you must pass a monthly assessment in a secret training simulator. All workers know this process by heart: you need to be trained in risky conditions and prove that you can deactivate Sparky Marky in an emergency. But this time something went wrong...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418290/extras/a58a7d142921a012d39fb10c8fbe30f9.poster.avif?t=1690193554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418290/extras/a58a7d142921a012d39fb10c8fbe30f9.webm?t=1690193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418290/extras/a58a7d142921a012d39fb10c8fbe30f9.mp4?t=1690193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lurk into the universe filled with strange creatures and scares;<br></li><li>Look up for the clues and secrets on the backstages of facility;<br></li><li>Solve puzzles to deactivate Sparky and monster inside of it;<br></li><li>Jump when Susie says to.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418290/extras/3829170edb54c5db28e7207b9534770d.poster.avif?t=1690193554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418290/extras/3829170edb54c5db28e7207b9534770d.webm?t=1690193554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418290/extras/3829170edb54c5db28e7207b9534770d.mp4?t=1690193554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
